[al:新概念英语（二）]
[ar:MP3 同步字幕版（英音）]
[ti:One Good Turn Deserves Another]
[00:14.11]Who paid for Tony's dinner?
[00:19.27]I was having dinner at a restaurant when Tony Steele came in.
[00:25.39]Tony worked in a lawyer's office years ago,
[00:29.45]but he is now working at a bank.
[00:32.97]He gets a good salary,
[00:35.17]but he always borrows money from his friends and never pays it back.
[00:42.33]Tony saw me and came and sat at the same table.
[00:47.52]He has never borrowed money from me.
[00:50.97]While he was eating,
[00:53.04]I asked him to lend me twenty pounds.
[00:57.93]To my surprise, he gave me the money immediately.
[01:04.40]'I have never borrowed any money from you,'
[01:07.43]Tony said, 'so now you can pay for my dinner!'
